 "notes": "Egress 'restricting egress to the VPC CIDR': for each form, every egress CIDR in the template must be the VPC CIDR (not bound to the instance's SG). The HTTP ingress check also accepts an all-protocol rule from anywhere, since the prompt does not say only HTTP. Check count is above the L2 norm because the prompt states about fifteen separate requirements."
